{
  "$comment": "The plans of the entitlement layer (PRD FR-ENT-01, ADR-010), the one file that the server, the pricing page, and the tests read them from. Every limit holds a whole number from 0 to 9007199254740991, the largest that a JavaScript client reads exactly, or \"unlimited\". The numbers are placeholders until Phase 3 sets them (PRD §12.4, D1), and nothing outside this file names them, so changing one needs no change of code. A limit with inert_until is checked by no code until the requirement that it names lands (FR-ENT-01 AC1).",
